Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.08,0:00:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}NOVEMBER 11TH
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.52,0:00:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,November 11th?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a special day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I know. 11-11. Make a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure I'm gonna be busy around then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm busy that day, and it's\Nsomething that I can't get out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.22,0:00:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, big sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to Yani Neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.22,0:01:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we've rehearsed enough now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe she was\Nactually worried about her birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.48,0:01:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess Yani Neko has a soft side, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.16,0:01:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, what is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made this stuffed Yani\Nas a present for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used some of her real hair which\Nmade it look like she has a twin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.64,0:01:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anywho, I wonder why\NYaniko isn't here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.46,0:01:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me nobody thought\Nto invite her to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.42,0:01:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now wouldn't that just be a hoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.82,0:01:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.05,0:01:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.86,0:02:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.02,0:03:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's over, I'll just be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.18,0:03:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's over, I'll only be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.98,0:03:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,3401! 3401! 3401! 0101! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is Kaoruko here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.70,0:03:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaoruko, her first name, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you freaking out so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.90,0:03:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.81,0:03:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know Kaoruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.26,0:03:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.70,0:03:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never even held\Nhands with a guy before!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is such a traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:03:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wh-what do you want with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought her panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.62,0:04:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's even doing it with this guy!?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doggy style. Shower sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With cuddling after.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.46,0:04:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're out of curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.56,0:04:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing, dumbass?! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch my panty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.86,0:04:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Hame, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.84,0:04:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ignore him, he's a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.54,0:04:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a traitor! What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the mix-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.12,0:04:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This jackass here is my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, the name's\NShunran, nice to meet ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.98,0:04:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how\Nmuch I hate you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, you made it too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.94,0:04:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.85,0:04:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're siblings then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured it was that\Nto be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, there's no way that you\Nwould have a boyfriend, right Kansai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:04:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I wasn't gonna let you trick me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the truth is,\Nwe're only half-siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.48,0:05:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forbidden love? Quit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.54,0:05:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you he's lying
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.66,0:05:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nishi, you want another drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, you can have some of mine It tastes\Nbetter Would you guys leave her alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone's gonna get her another drink,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's me You all are sweet I'm gonna step\Naway I'm gonna go find the powder room
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't leave us,\NNishi I love you so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nishi How many times are\Nyou gonna say that to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just pretend I didn't hear that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.30,0:05:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm gonna smell like smoke huh\Nnishi uh i thought you went
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the bathroom oh yeah well i\Njust wanted to sober up a bit
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.52,0:06:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah, so did I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chilly out here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nishi,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.41,0:06:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to say something\NYou're really mature
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you're considerate as\Nwell You're also graceful
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm none of those things, though Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,listen to you Come on, that's\Ncrazy talk No, no, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could never be the\Norganizer for a party I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really good at talking to\Npeople like you are Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.52,0:06:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only reason I'm the organizer\Nis because I finished my thesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.56,0:06:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm not that good\Nat socializing, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a pervert alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never a dull moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.52,0:06:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to head back inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.70,0:06:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.74,0:06:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pervert has burned to a crisp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.34,0:06:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody catch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yanni's the downtown pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you cooking inside\Na volcano, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you make a bonfire,\Nyou gotta be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.94,0:07:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you part fireman?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.04,0:07:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be burned to a crisp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.46,0:07:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hang on, Nishi, is this\Nwhat you normally act like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.64,0:07:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say it's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name isn't Nishi, it's Kansai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your damn mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.86,0:07:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.04,0:07:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.77,0:07:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love this sight of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that, up until now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were so perfect it\Nwas hard to approach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now that I've seen this, I really...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.18,0:07:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really want you to be my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.76,0:07:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kansai, give me a cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.72,0:07:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you just go away?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.94,0:07:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? You smoke even though\Nyou're still a college student?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no I wouldn't say that but I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.98,0:07:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,smoke too just promise me you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't tell anyone else about\Nthis okay your little cigarettes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's quite a choice of brand\Nyou got there anyway I Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guess that's that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.02,0:08:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.70,0:08:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.52,0:08:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you keep up the act?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.26,0:08:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's definitely not easy.\NGive me a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first wind of spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.90,0:08:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.06,0:08:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was three full days\Nworth of work! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind just blew away\Nmy entire manuscript!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.00,0:09:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your manuscript?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to say, you really\Nsaved me back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.56,0:09:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't shown up right then, I\Nfor sure wouldn't have made my deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.32,0:09:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad it happened, because now I get\Nto visit a professional's workplace!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.08,0:09:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time really does fly, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.38,0:09:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a year ago, and we\Nblink and it's almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.00,0:09:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a pretty eventful year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.34,0:09:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though you're a published author,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.62,0:09:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were still kind enough to give\Nadvice to an amateur writer like me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.69,0:09:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come on, stop it You don't look\Nup to her way too much Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah, of course I look up to her
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tatsuro makes a living doing\Nsomething that she loves She's an
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.64,0:09:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inspiration to me Isn't that why\Nyou're working as her assistant now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.56,0:09:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yani?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.47,0:10:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never actually read Tatsuro's manga
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.86,0:10:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you'd read it at least once so\Nyou'd remember the character's hair color.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.26,0:10:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, your own assistant hasn't\Neven read your books before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just not acceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.24,0:10:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a creator, that lack of awareness is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you even read her manga before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.32,0:10:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I bought all of them, but I'm\Njust saving them to read another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.66,0:10:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've been busy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.44,0:10:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does she seriously still believe\Nin Santa? She's not the type
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to do something all cute like\Nthat Maybe it's just a prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want to bet she asked\Nfor cigarettes or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.60,0:11:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, she's the one who wanted to\Nhave this Christmas drinking party
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.04,0:11:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Santa,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a nice smoking area for\NChristmas would be nice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.44,0:11:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You smoke with or without\Na smoking area. Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.78,0:11:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's not something you\Ncan put in a stocking Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.66,0:11:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she wrote more on the back
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and smoking with my friends\Nin the sun would be great Oh, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that made me kind of emotional
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. Who knew she had
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.30,0:11:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feelings look
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at us doing the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.22,0:11:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing I have to say I'm beat I\Nhaven't played in snow since I
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was a kid hi guys I brought
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,treats
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sake and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:11:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow. My favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is super cozy wouldn't be
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.28,0:12:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,angry if we did this again sometime
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,definitely
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is the cold making these drinks stronger\Noh don't blame the cold it's just the booze
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the trash is a pain in the ass
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.36,0:12:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow sculptures?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're so elaborate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.30,0:13:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna rescue us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.20,0:13:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure if I keep drinking at this\Npace, I'll be trashed before New Year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.86,0:13:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't pass out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still have to go to the Shrine tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.64,0:13:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who falls asleep loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.42,0:13:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't really taste like sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.39,0:13:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if anyone falls asleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then they have to shove their\Nunderwear in the landlord's mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.56,0:13:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we have to stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.18,0:13:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.14,0:13:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know he would love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.08,0:13:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We seriously can't fall asleep now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.38,0:13:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, I'm kind of sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker cat, Chainsmoker cat, cat,\Ncat, Chainsmoker, chainsmoker cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.62,0:14:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the annual New Year's\NMochi Pounding begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.02,0:14:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yani Neko, I'll pound it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pour water on the\Nmochi and knead it, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand the landlord\Nbeing all excited,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.98,0:14:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but what's with Yanni being so fired up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe she got cigarettes as payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's way too early in the\Nmorning to be doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super mochi, pound!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.86,0:14:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.77,0:14:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Been a while since I've shown\Noff my high-speed mochi-pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.98,0:14:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm a little rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.51,0:14:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did Yaniko go? Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:14:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe she ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should have expected\Nthat from her. Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once it cools down, we'll shape it. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.76,0:15:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I putting red bean paste in these ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those are gonna\Nbe the mugwort mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know that Mugwort is said to\Nward off evil spirits and misfortune?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or as some call it, Yaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you guys think this mochi kind\Nof looks like Yanni's hair color?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.38,0:15:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that! It might start\Nsmelling like cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's fire this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.60,0:15:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yani Neko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.34,0:15:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.22,0:15:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was my first dream of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:15:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had bad omen written all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long are you going to keep sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you wake up already?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.92,0:16:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, it's time to pound some mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.86,0:16:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First of all, Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.28,0:16:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for our building's\Nannual New Year's mochi-pounding!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yani Neko! Nyup!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.36,0:16:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pound it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your job is to pour water on the\Nmochi and knead it. Got it? Nyup!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand the landlord\Nbeing all excited,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but what's with Yani being so fired up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's paying her in\Na bunch of cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's way too early in the\Nmorning to be doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get it done, Yanni-Niko!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.64,0:16:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.76,0:16:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.86,0:16:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.56,0:16:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With gusto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said it was cigarette poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.10,0:17:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poor thing was still so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.10,0:17:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that bald guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.66,0:17:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently a cigarette got mixed\Ninto the mochi he was making.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.22,0:17:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to pound some mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I in a time loop?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.36,0:17:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to pound some mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.20,0:17:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pound the mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why it's happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.54,0:17:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I keep repeating the day\Nof the mochi pounding, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:17:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hameko!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone dies every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.48,0:18:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each day starts off the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's pound the mochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to escape\Nfrom this time loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.26,0:18:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, if I can just finish this mochi\Npounding peacefully without anyone dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.14,0:18:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weather is awesome for New Year's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.74,0:18:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect for making mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The landlord seems a\Nlittle bit sad though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when do we get to eat this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.70,0:18:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.08,0:18:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Confine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.99,0:18:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever they got close to the\Nmortar, a fatal accident would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need to do something crazy\Nenough to keep them all away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.64,0:18:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This going balls out,\Ncouple with the mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That being stomped around like\Na fiddled fish out of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should keep everyone away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.32,0:18:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, the cannon's things are kicking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:19:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy, don't touch it inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Yani, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's all strikes and no balls! It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.86,0:19:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was both soft and\Nhigh at the same time.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.70,0:19:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}THEY'RE ALIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.70,0:19:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The loop didn't start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.61,0:19:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has it ended?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.30,0:19:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I the only one that knows\Nabout this loop of fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Otani, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.12,0:19:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just received a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.98,0:19:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please come with us to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.60,0:19:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.18,0:19:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.60,0:19:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we'd go get some\NAwachi Island burgers today!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.26,0:20:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the New Year,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we just relax a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.02,0:20:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relaxing was before eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.48,0:20:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And unless you plan on freezing\Nto death, we need more kerosene.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit lollygagging!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.66,0:20:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go and get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.88,0:20:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gosh, that's such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.72,0:20:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hands off, you dung beetle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.90,0:20:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, for crying out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.62,0:20:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Traffic on a holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.84,0:20:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, I'll tear all\Nthese people a new one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.84,0:20:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See how much mom loves traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She sure is loud with her love. You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.32,0:20:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ever since you started living in that\Napartment, you've been acting more like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that back or a whoopper ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.76,0:20:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your damn mouths!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.74,0:20:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, we haven't moved\Nan inch and I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.64,0:20:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.12,0:20:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}MAIN INGREDIENTS: BEEF, LETTUCE, BUNS,\NFRIED ONIONS, CHEESE, SALT & PEPPER
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.92,0:20:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your homemade Awaji Eileen Berger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.26,0:20:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing better than being at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You realize you're the\None who wanted to go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:20:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:21:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaoruko, did you put on a\Nfew pounds over the holidays?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.74,0:21:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want my old maternity clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not that big.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.18,0:21:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want them, Shunran? Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.14,0:21:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you do kind of have\Na big butt, though, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.94,0:21:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wear those clothes backwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the part that's for the belly\Nwill fit over your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.32,0:21:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more burgers if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.84,0:21:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.26,0:21:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a cow, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.28,0:21:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.86,0:21:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After we eat, it's family time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.26,0:21:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we all play a board game\Ntogether and watch Shinkigeki?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.84,0:21:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.90,0:21:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't been back home in a good\Nwhile, so Mom's all needy, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.90,0:21:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I have an idea. You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.36,0:21:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been working on my beatboxing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.24,0:21:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if you lose, that means\Nyou got to stay longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.68,0:21:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.59,0:21:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get this going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.51,0:22:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done some things, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.20,0:22:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this goddamn house.
